==Battleground==
*1 [[Zollow]] spawns after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*2 [[Mistress Celeboodle]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*5 [[Relic Doge]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Lord Gravey]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Relic Doge]]s spawn, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
**2 [[Zollow]]s spawn after 1.33 seconds<sup>40f</sup>, delay 1 second<sup>30f</sup>.
**10 [[Mistress Celeboodle]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
**1 [[M. Ost]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
**2 [[Zollow]]s spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 1 second<sup>30f</sup>.
**2 [[Zollow]]s spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 1 second<sup>30f</sup>.
**2 [[Zollow]]s spawn after 150 seconds<sup>4,500f</sup>, delay 1 second<sup>30f</sup>.

==Strategy==
[[Master Uril (Special Cat)|Esoteric Uril]] completely destroys this stage. With his stat buffs from his True Form, his Surge instantly kills the Zollows here, making them a minimal threat. Aside from that, the M. Ost here poses little threat due to units like [[Awakened Naala]] existing, and the Lord Gravey not only gets stalled by [[Shigong Cat]], but also gives you a bulky stepping stone for your Urils and Naalas to connect hits onto.

==Trivia==
*Slanderous Wasteland appears to have been designed specifically for [[Mighty Kat-A-Pult (Uber Rare Cat)|CAT-10 Gigapult]], the [[Ultra Form]] added in [[Version 13.1 Update|Version 13.1]] alongside [[Garden of Wilted Thoughts]]. CAT-10 Gigapult gains a [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic]] target and Immune to Curse for [[Relic Doge]] and [[M. Ost]] and Immune to Toxic for [[Zollow]], on top of already being an [[:Category:Anti-Zombie Cats|anti-Zombie unit]].

